e_name": "SS-01.png", "id": "590240793608402", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221321_590240796941735_2272622210460028300_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=__LYP3eT-bkQ7kNvwHpCtgO&_nc_oc=Adr_IIWZX7F9Bieda9JZKFt_B6cOc4nkONrHImxHa6J_9dN88xKt1ioO8QqooSwnm4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSbDH14hF1ZfysIU9TFngoiraGlDxdFA6h5blX2tBHziA&oe=6B0DCB70"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GalacticCorridor_Cover_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "4627193387562551", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_4627193390895884_5312934501684470882_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2yq4GeKzlJ8Q7kNvwHKb5v5&_nc_oc=AdpgAIKd1tyqAQyeLNKGN3s26r3bH2sE6DUW1STFulAhWaMS4F70SMkkc1VW0XsUnnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQRmjIETDtM284nyUlib2vu6t_-_YoqKz8EoqnzazQZFw&oe=6B0DC43B"}, "display_name": "Galactic Corridor: Space Shooter", "keywords": ["Spaceship", "Alien", "Galaxy", "Dogfight", "Starship"], "long_description": "Galactic Corridor takes you on an exhilarating journey through the farthest corners of space. As a skilled pilot, you\u2019ll navigate your advanced spacecraft through treacherous corridors, seeking out high-value targets across the galaxy. Equipped with powerful weapons and shields, your mission is clear: hunt down your enemies and obliterate them before they can strike back.\n\nThe game combines fast-paced space battles with strategic planning, as you carefully aim, dodge incoming fire, and track down targets in complex space environments. Each mission brings a new challenge, with diverse settings ranging from asteroid fields to alien-infested zones. Upgrade your ship, unlock new weapons, and become a legendary force in the universe. In Galactic Corridor, it\u2019s not just about survival\u2014it\u2019s about domination. Get ready to conquer